  "name": "CV Screener - The Divergence Gate",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ee81410a-88c9-47ee-bedf-2147dbb5377f",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## CV Screener - The Divergence Gate\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow receives a CV through an application form, checks the submitted file format, and routes valid applications through two independent screening paths. One path extracts raw text for a Gemini text review, while the other renders the PDF to an image for a Gemini vision review. The workflow merges both verdicts, compares their scores and qualification flags, then either quarantines divergent results or sends a clean notification before logging the application.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the application form fields, especially the CV/file upload field and the allowed file-format conditions in The Format Gate.\n- Add credentials and API keys for Google Gemini on both the text and vision LLM nodes, and confirm the structured output parser schemas match the expected verdict fields.\n- Configure the ConvertAPI HTTP request used to render PDFs to images, including authentication and the expected response format for Base64 To Image.\n- Set up Telegram bot credentials and chat IDs for clean, flagged, wrong-format, and vision-path-failure notifications.\n- Connect Google Drive credentials and choose the quarantine folder for flagged/divergent applications.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and select the spreadsheet and worksheet used to log applications.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust the scoring thresholds and divergence logic in Compare Verdicts and The Divergence Gate, change the Gemini prompts/parser schemas for different hiring criteria, and update the notification messages or quarantine destination to match your review process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5cb4e721-6ba3-4c79-b867-7d6f32d41563",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        560,
        576
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 720,
        "height": 416,
        "content": "## Receive and validate upload\n\nStarts the application intake, checks whether the uploaded CV is in an accepted format, and returns a form message when the file type is wrong."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f254f84c-9f36-4e00-a522-ef01a0a83e04",
